  "summary": "Malicious code in denowrap (PyPI)",
  "details": "During import or installation, package starts as an embedded executable. It is identified as a RAT from the Quasar/PulsarRAT family.\n\n\n---\n\nCategory: MALICIOUS - The campaign has clearly malicious intent, like infostealers.\n\n\nCampaign: 2026-11-denowrap\n\n\nReasons (based on the campaign):\n\n\n - obfuscation\n\n\n - The package contains code to detect if it is running in a sandbox environment.\n\n\n - malware\n\n\n - rat\n\n\n - The package overrides the install command in setup.py to execute malicious code during installation.\n\n",
